198
00:12:19,860 --> 00:12:30,720
To be fair, Ume was pretty bad, too.

199
00:12:31,620 --> 00:12:36,540
It's hard not to hate it, since you were named after the very disease that killed our mother.

200
00:12:38,900 --> 00:12:41,040
The Rashomon Riverbank.

201
00:12:41,620 --> 00:12:45,060
The lowest class of the entertainment district where we were born.

202
00:12:45,740 --> 00:12:50,520
Children here were seen as extra mouths to feed, so we were cursed for being born.

203
00:12:51,340 --> 00:12:54,840
My mother nearly killed me more than once while I was in her womb.

204
00:12:55,640 --> 00:13:00,100
She also tried to kill me after I was born, since I was nothing but a burden.

205
00:13:01,600 --> 00:13:03,620
And yet, I survived.

206
00:13:04,460 --> 00:13:07,220
My body was weak, like a withered leaf.

207
00:13:07,220 --> 00:13:10,400
But I clung to life with the strength I had left.

208
00:13:11,540 --> 00:13:12,060
Worm.

209
00:13:12,780 --> 00:13:13,340
Moron.

210
