Dead weight.

214
00:13:17,620 --> 00:13:20,720
I was mocked for my ugly voice and appearance.

215
00:13:21,260 --> 00:13:23,720
Sometimes they'd even throw rocks at me for it.

216
00:13:25,880 --> 00:13:31,780
It felt like every insult in the world was created to leave an emotional scar on me.

217
00:13:31,780 --> 00:13:37,540
Not only was I hideous, I was filthy, too.

218
00:13:38,120 --> 00:13:43,080
Covered in grime from head to toe, and giving off the stench of death.

219
00:13:44,460 --> 00:13:51,180
It didn't help that I lived in the entertainment district, where beauty was the measure of your value.

220
00:13:51,980 --> 00:13:53,700
I was treated like a monster.

221
00:13:54,840 --> 00:13:58,460
Whenever I would get hungry, I would eat mice and insects.

222
00:13:58,460 --> 00:14:04,140
My only toy was a sickle, a customer left behind.

223
00:14:06,060 --> 00:14:09,220
Soon, though, things started to change for me.

224
00:14:10,840 --> 00:14:12,880
After Ume was born.

225
00:14:17,120 --> 00:14:21,780
Ume, you were my pride and joy, you know.

226
00:14:21,780 --> 00:14:28,580
Even at a young age, people couldn't help but marvel at the sight of your beautiful face.

227
00:14:28,580 --> 00:14:36,860
