228
00:14:37,860 --> 00:14:41,280
I might have revolted everyone, but they feared me, too.

229
00:14:42,340 --> 00:14:44,380
And that brought me pure joy.

230
00:14:44,380 --> 00:14:50,460
My ugliness became my source of pride.

231
00:14:51,420 --> 00:14:57,920
And because I had such a gorgeous sister, my sense of inferiority was washed away as well.

232
00:14:57,920 --> 00:15:08,200
Call it wishful thinking, but I really had the feeling that we were on the fast track to a better life.

233
00:15:13,260 --> 00:15:15,600
