00:17:37,300 --> 00:17:44,760
But when you've got it as good as you do, you don't get to complain.

268
00:17:45,260 --> 00:17:48,740
Losing one of your eyes is nothing compared to what we go through every day.

269
00:17:48,740 --> 00:17:57,500
It's almost laughable, really.

270
00:18:05,500 --> 00:18:07,800
No one ever offered to help us.

271
00:18:08,360 --> 00:18:09,680
No surprises there.

272
00:18:10,900 --> 00:18:13,740
That was just the story of our daily lives.

273
00:18:14,740 --> 00:18:18,020
No one batted an eye to our suffering, even at its worst.

274
00:18:18,020 --> 00:18:24,580
And then it would start to snow.

275
00:18:25,640 --> 00:18:31,300
Day in and day out, we were neglected and denied any bit of mercy from bystanders.

276
00:18:34,060 --> 00:18:35,440
Why was that?

277
00:18:36,360 --> 00:18:39,740
So much for fortune and misfortune are intertwined.

278
00:18:40,280 --> 00:18:44,360
Our entire lives were filled with tragedy, pain, and suffering.

279
00:18:44,360 --> 00:18:49,400
You two don't look so good.

280
00:18:49,740 --> 00:18:51,160
Oh, you poor things.

281
00:18:52,620 --> 00:18:56,600
You're lucky someone as kind-hearted as me stumbled upon you.

282
00:18:56,600 --> 00:19:01,980
