283
00:19:03,160 --> 00:19:05,840
How about I give you some blood?

284
00:19:06,520 --> 00:19:07,720
What do you think of that?

285
00:19:09,000 --> 00:19:12,760
That way you can become demons, if he chooses you.

286
00:19:12,760 --> 00:19:19,380
Life is far too sacred to let it go to waste.

287
