296
00:20:14,820 --> 00:20:19,220
Had you only worked at a better house, you might have become a respectable Oiran.

297
00:20:21,380 --> 00:20:26,660
And if you'd been born to normal parents, maybe then you could have lived a normal life.

298
00:20:29,120 --> 00:20:30,060
