329
00:22:17,880 --> 00:22:21,240
I said it because I didn't want to admit that it was my fault it happened.

330
00:22:23,140 --> 00:22:26,260
I'm sorry for not putting up a horrible fight against them.

331
00:22:26,660 --> 00:22:28,660
I'm sorry I wasn't useful enough.

332
00:22:28,660 --> 00:22:30,980
I'm sorry I caused us to end up here.

333
00:22:30,980 --> 00:22:33,180
That I'm always dragging you down.

334
00:22:34,100 --> 00:22:35,680
Forgive me, please.

335
00:22:39,760 --> 00:22:42,740
From here on out, you're not my sister anymore.

336
00:22:42,840 --> 00:22:43,700
You're nothing to me.

337
